'''Black Marmod''' is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in the [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Black Marmod
|image = E 621.png
|appearance = [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 100¢ - 395¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy appears to be a black quadrupedal creature with an eye in its mouth. It has low overall stats. Even with its [[Omni Strike]], the most it can reach are your meatshields. If it does reach your attackers however, it can [[Knockback|knockback]] them.

==Strategy==
As long as your World Trigger units are well leveled, these shouldn't be much of a problem. [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|Chika Amatori]] in particular can be used to slow it down from a distance, while [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu Mikumo]] can protect her using his high health and [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immmunity]].

